(footprint "Fuseholder_Blade_Mini_XFCN_XF-508P-B-B"
	(version 20260206)
	(generator "pcbnew")
	(generator_version "10.0")
	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "XFCN XF-508P-B-B MINI (ATM) automotive blade fuse holder, THT. Hole grid 9.80 x 3.40mm, 4x 1.6mm drill per datasheet 'Ø1.6 MIN'. NOTE: pins are 0.40 x 1.60mm flat (diagonal 1.649mm), so a 1.6mm drill is a tight/interference fit and finishes undersized after plating - holes may need reaming. Body 16.00 x 6.70mm, 7.35mm tall, pins 2.85mm long. 500V, 15-30A, -40C..+125C. Pad 1 = left receptacle (both pins), pad 2 = right receptacle. Takes Littelfuse MINI 297/997 or Bussmann ATM fuses. LCSC C19727305.")
